## EstimateIQ — Comprehensive Project Overview

### 1. What the Project Does

**EstimateIQ** is an AI-powered enterprise platform for processing RFP (Request for Proposal) documents. The core workflow: upload RFP files (PDF, DOCX, XLSX) → AI automatically parses, chunks, classifies, and extracts all software requirements → requirements are searchable via semantic/vector search. The end goal is automating requirement extraction and cost/effort estimation for enterprise bid teams. The README describes it as "Phase 1" — the foundation is built, with estimation and timeline features as planned extensions.

