### 3. Main Features / Modules

**Backend**
- **Upload** (`POST /upload`) — accepts 1–10 files per batch (PDF/DOCX/XLSX), validates size, stores to disk under UUID project dirs, creates DB records
- **Projects** — full CRUD for projects; each project groups multiple documents; re-extraction endpoint (`POST /projects/{id}/reextract`)
- **Document Processing** — async Celery pipeline parses files to text, triggers downstream tasks
- **LLM Requirement Extraction** — single-call LLM extraction from full document text, produces structured requirements with IDs (FR-01, NFR-02, etc.), types, priority, confidence score, page numbers
- **Chunking** — hierarchical document chunking with heading detection and hierarchy building
- **Semantic Chunking + Classification** — semantic splitting + rule-based classification of chunks into categories (functional, security, integration, etc.)
- **Vector Embeddings** — BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5 embeddings for each semantic chunk; stored in PostgreSQL (Qdrant integration prepared but currently disabled)
- **Retrieval / Semantic Search** (`POST /search`) — semantic search, category-based search, similar-chunk lookup, project statistics
- **Jobs** (`GET /jobs`) — Celery job status tracking

**Frontend**
